concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 At the end of section 1B"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (3) A reference in any other Act to a Royal Commission (being a Royal Commission established by the Governor-General by Letters Patent under this Act or any other power) includes a reference to one or more members of a Commission holding an authorised member hearing." ;
    skos:definition "Add:  (3) A reference in any other Act to a Royal Commission (being a Royal Commission established by the Governor-General by Letters Patent under this Act or any other power) includes a reference to one or more members of a Commission holding an authorised member hearing."@en ;
