concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6oa a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6OA Definitions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6oa ;
    values:originalText "In this Part: Child Sexual Abuse Royal Commission means the Royal Commission into Institutional Responses to Child Sexual Abuse issued by the Governor-General by Letters Patent on 11 January 2013 (and including any later variations of those Letters Patent). private session means a private session held under section 6OB." ;
    skos:definition "In this Part: Child Sexual Abuse Royal Commission means the Royal Commission into Institutional Responses to Child Sexual Abuse issued by the Governor-General by Letters Patent on 11 January 2013 (and including any later variations of those Letters Patent). private session means a private session held under section 6OB."@en ;
