concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6oe a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6OE Statements made and documents produced etc. at a private"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6oe ;
    values:originalText "session are not admissible in evidence  (1) The following are not admissible in evidence against a natural person in any civil or criminal proceedings in any court of the Commonwealth, of a State or of a Territory:  (a) a statement or disclosure made by the person at a private session;  (b) the production of a document or other thing by the person at a private session.  (2) Subsection (1) does not apply to the admissibility of evidence in proceedings for an offence against this Act." ;
    skos:definition "session are not admissible in evidence  (1) The following are not admissible in evidence against a natural person in any civil or criminal proceedings in any court of the Commonwealth, of a State or of a Territory:  (a) a statement or disclosure made by the person at a private session;  (b) the production of a document or other thing by the person at a private session.  (2) Subsection (1) does not apply to the admissibility of evidence in proceedings for an offence against this Act."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f3f718f377e11f1548308676e39eca3fc814e502da3a0b52a619a25355ae2bf0" ;
    cof:pageNumber "14"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6oe-ss-1 ;
