concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6ok a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6OK Defence for disclosure to person who provided the information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6ok ;
    values:originalText "Section 6OH does not apply to a disclosure of information to the person who gave the information at a private session. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in this section (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code)." ;
    skos:definition "Section 6OH does not apply to a disclosure of information to the person who gave the information at a private session. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in this section (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code)."@en ;
