concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6ol a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6OL No other exceptions under other laws"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6ol ;
    values:originalText "(1) A provision of a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory has no effect to the extent that it would otherwise require or authorise a person to make a record of, use or disclose information obtained at a private session if the record, use or disclosure:  (a) would contravene a provision of this Division; or  (b) would not be permitted by a provision of this Division.  (2) Subsection (1) has effect whether the provision concerned is made before or after the commencement of this section." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A provision of a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory has no effect to the extent that it would otherwise require or authorise a person to make a record of, use or disclose information obtained at a private session if the record, use or disclosure:  (a) would contravene a provision of this Division; or  (b) would not be permitted by a provision of this Division.  (2) Subsection (1) has effect whether the provision concerned is made before or after the commencement of this section."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ced7ba6cce13e558d3bfe0e9b4d70a1b9441f0ed5518daa8bf097ffb1c34951d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "16"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6ol-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:royal-commissions-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-6ol-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
