    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of the Archives Act 1983, a record:  (a) that contains information obtained at a private session; or  (b) that relates to a private session and identifies a natural person who appeared at a private session; is in the open access period on and after 1 January in the year that is 99 years after the calendar year that the record came into existence.  (2) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) applies in relation to a record even if the record came into existence after the private session. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00024  Amendments  Schedule 1  (3) Subsection 3(7) and section 56 of the Archives Act 1983 do not apply to a record referred to in subsection (1)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of the Archives Act 1983, a record:  (a) that contains information obtained at a private session; or  (b) that relates to a private session and identifies a natural person who appeared at a private session; is in the open access period on and after 1 January in the year that is 99 years after the calendar year that the record came into existence.  (2) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) applies in relation to a record even if the record came into existence after the private session. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00024  Amendments  Schedule 1  (3) Subsection 3(7) and section 56 of the Archives Act 1983 do not apply to a record referred to in subsection (1)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "52675b668d6379f1b6b54d391cef89a2dde48f749ab5f8cc277f950f907bf916" ;
